      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wausaukee%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A railroad station was built along the Milwaukee and Northern railroad line in 1883 and called Wausaukee.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
